// K-column per-diagnostic archive anchors (2026-09-17, Publish 族定稿 + HomePage + 尾部).
// A component fn's cascade diagnostics name no root ("unresolved identifier 'x'" / a
// composite whose leading witness belongs to a sibling channel) while their true root
// lives in a DIFFERENT sibling fn of the same closure — a single fnId→class inheritance
// entry would mislabel the fn's other roots. Each entry pins the exact csg.function id
// AND an exact reason anchor, audited line-by-line against the closure source (the
// G-column fid-pinned audit discipline):
