  // against the facts), so the initializer call cannot be emitted; the slot type IS the
  // symbol's own declared annotation, and the compiled slot starts at the type's zero
  // value. Hydration is the host-wired boundary (the same unwired-bridge contract as the
  // subscribe wiring points): reads before the first write observe the zero struct.
  // Types must map cleanly; unmappable lets are not admitted (their reads keep failing
